-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sun Oct 18 05:59:50 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 4.4.1 (major rewrite, same C API, SONAME 0 -> 0.4):
  * Library rewritten in Rust; built with cargo-c instead of
    configure/make. Shlib package renamed libimagequant0 to
    libimagequant0_4.
  * OpenMP support dropped in favor of rayon threads
    (use RAYON_NUM_THREADS to control thread count).
  * Version 4.1: improved dithering over preset background,
    new remap_into_vec, fix for images over 16 megapixels.
  * Version 4.2: reworked fixed palette color handling, support
    for palettes larger than 256 colors.
  * Version 4.3: performance improvements, copyable Image object.
  * Version 4.4: palette quality improvements, new
    Histogram::from_palette constructor.
- Packaging: fetch vendored sources via _service (cargo_vendor),
  build with cargo-c; drop lcms2 BuildRequires (no longer used).

